# Conventional Commit Co-Authors
#
# This file defines co-authors for use with the Conventional Commit plugin
# Format: alias=Name <email@example.com>
#
# Usage in JetBrains IDEs:
# When making a commit, you can reference co-authors by their alias

# Example co-authors (replace with actual team members)
# john=John Doe <john.doe@example.com>
# jane=Jane Smith <jane.smith@example.com>
# claude=Claude AI <noreply@anthropic.com>